      "solution": "n = int(input())\ng = [input() for _ in range(n)]\n\ncorners = 0\nfor r in range(n):\n    for c in range(n):\n        if c + 1 < n and g[r][c] + g[r][c + 1] in (\"/\\\\\", \"\\\\/\"):\n            corners += 1\n        if r + 1 < n and g[r][c] + g[r + 1][c] in (\"/\\\\\", \"\\\\/\"):\n            corners += 1\n\nprint((corners - 4) // 2)",
